        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Under aerobic conditions, H3L (0.015 g, 0.0435 mmol) and acetylacetone (0.0045 mL, 0.0435 mmol) were dissolved in 15 mL MeOH. Er(NO3)3·5H2O (0.032 g, 0.0725 mmol) and Et3N (0.030 mL, 0.215 mmol) were added. The mixture was stirred for 24 h at room temperature, producing a colored solution, then filtered. The filtrate was kept for slow evaporation, affording orange single crystals after 2 weeks.",
